1
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:08,233
What the hell
are you doing there?

2
00:00:08,233 --> 00:00:10,133
It's so hot, and you're
just hanging out here!

3
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:13,267
Why are you out here?
See? You're getting dirty!

4
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,133
What's this on your hand?

5
00:00:15,133 --> 00:00:22,067
[SOFT BRIGHT MUSIC PLAYING]

6
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:44,133
[SOFT BRIGHT MUSIC CONTINUES]

7
00:00:57,333 --> 00:00:59,167
[RUSTLING]

8
00:00:59,167 --> 00:01:03,733
[SOFT BRIGHT MUSIC CONTINUES]

9
00:01:03,733 --> 00:01:05,300
Junifer Sampaga,

10
00:01:06,633 --> 00:01:08,133
will you be mine?

11
00:01:08,167 --> 00:01:15,100
[SOFT BRIGHT MUSIC CONTINUES]

12
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:16,500
If for you everything is fake,

13
00:01:17,167 --> 00:01:18,733
there's nothing fake
about what I feel.

14
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:22,167
So... why not make it real?

15
00:01:23,267 --> 00:01:24,400
Is this real?

16
00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:27,333
Because...
I'm still a bit confused.

17
00:01:27,333 --> 00:01:28,400
I love you.

18
00:01:29,633 --> 00:01:33,533
And I'll marry you
in any church.

19
00:01:34,533 --> 00:01:36,700
Even if I'm not a Rose by blood?

20
00:01:37,333 --> 00:01:39,500
Even if your name is Junifer.

21
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,600
[CLICKS TONGUE] That was quick,
Fulgencio Nabong III.

22
00:01:43,567 --> 00:01:44,767
Can I...

23
00:01:44,767 --> 00:01:47,067
Can I process all of this first?

24
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:48,867
It's up to you.

25
00:01:48,867 --> 00:01:50,600
I'll court you no matter
how long it takes.

26
00:01:50,867 --> 00:01:52,367
Even if it's forever?

27
00:01:52,567 --> 00:01:54,700
I'll make you fall in love
even if it takes forever.

28
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,867
Even if I have trouble hearing
and I stutter?

29
00:01:57,867 --> 00:02:01,400
Even if you stutter so much.

30
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,567
What if...

31
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:05,167
I want all the leftover
rice for myself?

32
00:02:05,767 --> 00:02:07,733
Well, that wasn't part
of the conversation.

33
00:02:07,733 --> 00:02:08,900
[SNICKERS]

34
00:02:08,900 --> 00:02:11,100
- I thought it was true love.
- [PING] I'm kidding!

35
00:02:11,100 --> 00:02:12,567
We can share it, right?

36
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:15,300
As long as I don't lose you.

37
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:18,733
Just give me a chance
to be your boyfriend.

38
00:02:22,667 --> 00:02:23,667
Fine!

39
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:25,700
As long as it's not fake, okay?

40
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,267
This time, it's not fake.

41
00:02:28,267 --> 00:02:29,600
[JUNE GIGGLING]

42
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:36,567
[PLAYING "IKAW LANG" BY 1621]

43
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:05,233
My sister hope
forever!

44
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,700
I heard my son
was here.

45
00:03:12,567 --> 00:03:13,800
Are You My Father?
